sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as Position owner
  participant W as Wallet test signer
  participant T as TeleportV3
  participant R as Policy Registry
  participant P as V3 Position Manager
  participant S as Optional single-hop router
  U->>W: Define position output minima deadline and swap bounds
  W->>W: Sign EIP-712 intent with chain and contract domain
  U->>T: Call executeAtomicMigration with parameters and signature
  T->>T: Check deadline owner signature and per-owner nonce
  T->>R: Read executor and asset policy
  alt Intent or Registry guard fails
    T-->>U: Revert and roll back the transaction
  else Guards pass
    T->>P: Decrease and remove liquidity then collect tokens
    opt Optional rebalance
      T->>S: Single-hop swap with signed minimum output
    end
    T->>P: Mint destination position to original owner
    T->>T: Refund defined excess and consume nonce
    T-->>U: Return new position ID and emit event
  end
